ournal articles and issues, CME, or events</li></ul></div></div><a href="https://www.aafp.org/ams/account/site/create-account" target="_self" class="aafp-btn login-modal__btn">Create account</a></section><section class="login-modal__col"><span class="login-modal__col-title" role="heading" aria-level="3">Join AAFP</span><div class="login-modal__col-content"><div><p>AAFP informs and advocates for family physicians throughout their careers. Join for access to:</p><ul><li>Unlimited AFP, FPM, and FP Essentials articles</li><li>Membership forums to connect with other members</li><li>Tools to take and report CME</li></ul></div></div><a href="/membership/join" target="_self" class="aafp-btn login-modal__btn">Become a member</a></section></div></div><div class="aafp-modal__footer"><a href="/#" class="aafp-btn aafp-modal__dismiss-btn login-modal__btn login-modal__close-btn">Close &amp; return</a></div></div></div><div id="my-account-flyout-desktop" class="my-account-flyout my-account-flyout--desktop" aria-modal="true" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="my-account-main-nav-label" aria-hidden="true"><div class="my-account-flyout__dialog"><div class="my-account-flyout__header"><div class="my-account-flyout__header-content"><span id="my-account-main-nav-label" class="my-account-flyout__title" role="heading" aria-level="2">My account</span><button type="button" class="my-account-flyout__close-btn" aria-label="Close My Account menu"><span data-testid="icon-close" class="aafp-icon aafp-icon--close" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="aafp-icon__svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#aafp-web-close"></use></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="my-account-flyout__body" tabindex="-1"><div class="my-account-flyout__list"><div class="my-account-main-nav"><nav aria-labelledby="my-account-main-nav-label"><ul class="my-account-main-nav__list"><li class="my-account-main-nav-list-item"><a href="https://www.aafp.org/ams/account/portal/dashboard" target="_self">